# Google Analytics and Tag Manager configuration | Optional, only needed if using GA/GTM for analytics
GA_TRACKING_ID=# Replace with your Google Analytics tracking ID
GTM_CONTAINER_ID=# Replace with your Google Tag Manager container ID

# ALGOLIA search configuration | Optional, only needed if using Algolia for search
ALGOLIA_APP_ID=# Replace with your Algolia application ID
ALGOLIA_SEARCH_API_KEY=# Replace with your Algolia search-only API key
ALGOLIA_INDEX_NAME=# Replace with your Algolia index name